kwin-ctm-monitor (0.1.15-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Stop installing a global KDE autostart entry for kwinctmctl-restore.
    Login-time restore is too early on plasmalogin systems and can leave the
    session at a black screen with only the cursor visible.
  * Keep kwinctmctl-restore as an explicit manual command for users who want
    to reapply saved matrices after a Wayland session is already usable.

