kwin-ctm-monitor (0.1.8-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Keep persisted CTMs out of KWin's initial modeset validation.
  * Restore the identity hardware pipeline if a persisted CTM is rejected.
  * Share matrix validation between D-Bus and configuration loading.
  * Add CTM-specific patch contract and KWin validation tests.
  * Keep official Neon KWin packages available as a recovery candidate.
  * Use the APT hook as the single automatic build trigger.
